    "value": [
      "The letters A, E, I, O, and U are called **vowels**. Every word has at least one vowel in it!",
      "You already know the short sound each vowel makes.",
      "But here's the secret: a vowel can also say its own NAME!",
      "Listen: in the word ‘hat’, A says its short sound. But in the word ‘hate’... A says its name — A!",
      "When a vowel says its name, we call it a **long vowel** sound."
    ]
